snippet.description:
We say it all the time...."Height id Might" and "More Wire in the Air". Well, on this activation, I did both.  I pulled out the 80m aux wire for my Spooltenna EFHW and plugged it into the transformer.  Then I elevated the feed point to 30 ft with my carbon fiber painter's pole. The proof is in the contacts.  4 Bands, 58 Contacts, with DX to Ecuador!  Amazing performance on a day when conditions were less than ideal. 

